### Socially Backend - Donation API
### JetBrains HTTP Client Collection
### Documentation: https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/http-client-in-product-code-editor.html

## Health Check
### Check if the application is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Health check returns UP", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Response status is not 200");
        client.assert(response.body.status === "UP", "Application is not UP");
    });
%}

